 "headline": "Harden Drops 51 While Mambas Bench Cooks",
 "notes": [
  "James Harden has 51 points and seven threes for Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw, and the matchup is still only 5-4 theInfamous. Embarrassing for everyone involved.",
  "White Mambas just stole 3PT% and AST from LeParth James, and Trey Murphy III has 17 points sitting on their bench. Benching that is the luckiest crime of the night.",
  "Gopher Gold sit first tonight because Aday Mara has 22 points and 16 boards on 11-of-15 shooting. Suggs to be you is watching it from 8-3 down.",
  "Adam Silver Dez Nuts took FG% from MONSTARS right now, riding Ivica Zubac's 21 points, 10 boards and 3 blocks. Jalen Johnson's 26 points are being wasted at 3-8.",
  "theInfamous own the worst night in the league while leading, and Darius Acuff Jr. is 2-of-7 for 4 points. A 5-4 lead built on Day'Ron Sharpe alone is fragile."
 ],
